      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "AI-native developers and power users",
        "answer": "Developers, technical founders, indie hackers, automation builders, and heavy ChatGPT, Claude, or Codex users are the strongest first audience. They already understand repositories, structured data, agents, tools, and persistent state. Twilite does not have to teach them why an AI should be able to operate on something more durable than a chat transcript.",
        "confidence": "high",
        "summary": "People already building with AI are the shortest path from demo to understanding.",
        "notes": "",
