        "answer": "Researchers, writers, designers, strategists, educators, and serious note-takers form a natural second ring because they value revisitable visual structure. Agent and application builders may become the deepest long-term market: for them Twilite is not merely a workspace, but an environment agents can inspect, navigate, and manipulate.",
        "confidence": "high",
        "summary": "Expand toward visual knowledge workers; platform depth may ultimately come from agent builders.",
        "notes": "",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "twilite-target-audience-qa"
        },
        "_classBinding": {
          "key": "qa-answer",
          "sourceRef": "github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/question-driven-explanation-template/classes/nodes/qa-answer.node-class.node"
        },
